मा बु।\",\n        phonetic: \"Tisin bu buru reya miad chalak kulai aur kul ren seday kahani ayuma bu.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"बुरु (Forest)\", \"कुलइ (Rabbit)\", \"कुल (Tiger)\", \"कहानी (Story)\"]\n      },\n      ho: {\n        script: \"Warang Chiti / Devanagari\",\n        text: \"ᱛᱤᱥᱤᱝ ᱵᱩ ᱵᱤᱨ ᱨᱮᱱᱟ ᱢᱤᱭᱟᱫ ᱪᱟᱞᱟᱠ ᱠᱩᱞᱟᱹᱭ ᱟᱱᱫᱳ ᱠᱩᱞ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱠᱟᱹᱦᱱᱤ ᱟᱭᱩᱢᱟ ᱵᱩ।\",\n        devanagariText: \"तिसिंग बु बीर रेना मियाद चालाक कुलइ आन्दो कुल रेयाग कहनी आयुमा बु।\",\n        phonetic: \"Tising bu beer rena miyad chalak kulai aando kul reyag kahni ayuma bu.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"बीर (Forest)\", \"कुलइ (Rabbit)\", \"कुल (Tiger)\"]\n      },\n      kurukh: {\n        script: \"Devanagari\",\n        text: \"इन्नू नाम मझी पद्दी ता ओन्ता चतुर लम्बहा अरा लकड़ा ही खिस्सी मेन्ओत।\",\n        phonetic: \"Innu naam majhi paddi ta onta chatur lambha ara lakda hee khissi men'ot.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"लम्बहा (Rabbit)\", \"लकड़ा (Tiger)\", \"खिस्सी (Story)\"]\n      },\n      kharia: {\n        script: \"Devanagari\",\n        text: \"आईज हामिन जंगल केर एकठो चतुर खरगोश अउर बाघ केर कहानी सुनब।\",\n        phonetic: \"Aaij hamin jangal ker ektho chatur khargosh aur bagh ker kahani sunab.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"जंगल (Forest)\", \"कहानी (Story)\"]\n      },\n      bengali: {\n        script: \"Bengali\",\n        text: \"আজ আমরা জঙ্গলের এক চালাক খরগোশ এবং বাঘের প্রাচীন লোককথা শুনব।\",\n        phonetic: \"Aaj amra jongoler ek chalak khorgosh ebong bagher prachin lokkotha shunbo.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"খরগোশ (Rabbit)\", \"বাঘ (Tiger)\", \"লোককথা (Folk tale)\"]\n      },\n      odia: {\n        script: \"Odia\",\n        text: \"ଆଜି ଆମେ ଜଙ୍ଗଲରେ ଏକ ଚତୁର ଠେକୁଆ ଏବଂ ବାଘର ପ୍ରାଚୀନ ଲୋକକଥା ଶୁଣିବା।\",\n        phonetic: \"Aji ame jangalare eka chatura thekua ebam baghara prachina lokakatha suniba.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"ଠେକୁଆ (Rabbit)\", \"ବାଘ (Tiger)\", \"ଲୋକକଥା (Folk tale)\"]\n      },\n      tamil: {\n        script: \"Tamil\",\n        text: \"இன்று நாம் காட்டில் உள்ள ஒரு தந்திரமான முயல் மற்றும் புலியைப் பற்றிய நாட்டுப்புறக் கதையைக் கேட்போம்.\",\n        phonetic: \"Indru naam kaattil ulla oru thanthiramana muyal mattrum puliyai patriya naattuppura kadhaiyaik ketpom.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"முயல் (Rabbit)\", \"புலி (Tiger)\", \"கதை (Story)\"]\n      },\n      telugu: {\n        script: \"Telugu\",\n        text: \"ఈరోజు మనం అడవిలో ఒక తెలివైన కుందేలు మరియు పులి గురించి పురాతన జానపద కథ విందాం.\",\n        phonetic: \"Eeroju manam adavilo oka telivaina kundelu mariyu puli gurinchi puratana janapada katha vindam.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"కుందేలు (Rabbit)\", \"పులి (Tiger)\", \"కథ (Story)\"]\n      },\n      hindi: {\n        script: \"Devanagari\",\n        text: \"आज हम जंगल में एक चतुर खरगोश और एक बाघ की प्राचीन लोककथा सुनेंगे।\",\n        phonetic: \"Aaj hum jungle mein ek chatur khargosh aur ek baagh ki prachin lok-katha sunenge.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"खरगोश (Rabbit)\", \"बाघ (Tiger)\", \"लोककथा (Story)\"]\n      },\n      english: {\n        script: \"Latin\",\n        text: \"Today we will listen to an ancient folk tale about a clever rabbit and a tiger in the jungle.\",\n        phonetic: \"Today we will listen to an ancient folk tale about a clever rabbit and a tiger in the jungle.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"Folk tale\", \"Clever\", \"Rabbit\", \"Tiger\"]\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    id: \"preset_5\",\n    tag: \"science\",\n    en: \"Look outside at the rain clouds. The water cycle brings rain from the sky to nourish our crops and trees.\",\n    hi: \"बाहर बारिश के बादलों को देखो। वर्षा का जल चक्र आसमान से पानी लाकर हमारी फसलों और पेड़ों को सींचता है।\",\n    visual: {\n      emoji: \"🌧️🌱🌾\",\n      label: \"Rain, Water Cycle & Crops / वर्षा व फसलें\",\n      theme: \"#0284C7\"\n    },\n    translations: {\n      santhali: {\n        script: \"Ol Chiki & Devanagari\",\n        text: \"ᱵᱟᱦᱨᱮ ᱫᱟᱜ ᱨᱤᱢᱤᱞ ᱠᱚ ᱧᱮᱞ ᱯᱮ। ᱥᱮᱨᱢᱟ ᱠᱷᱚᱱ ᱫᱟᱜ ᱡᱟᱹᱲᱤ ᱧᱩᱨᱩᱜ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ ᱟᱨ ᱟᱵᱚᱣᱟᱜ ᱪᱟᱥ-ᱵᱟᱥ ᱡᱤᱣᱤᱫ ᱮᱫᱟᱭ।\",\n        devanagariText: \"बाहरे दाः रीमिल को ञेल पे। सेर्मा खोन दाः जाड़ी ञुरूः काना आर आबोवाः चास-बास जीविद एदाय।\",\n        phonetic: \"Bahre dag rimil ko njel pe. Serma khon dag jadi njurug kana aar abowag chas-bas jiwid eday.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"ᱨᱤᱢᱤᱞ (Rimil = Clouds)\", \"ᱫᱟᱜ (Dag = Rain)\", \"ᱥᱮᱨᱢᱟ (Serma = Sky)\", \"ᱪᱟᱥ-ᱵᱟᱥ (Chas-bas = Agriculture)\"]\n      },\n      mundari: {\n        script: \"Devanagari\",\n        text: \"बाहरे गामा रीमिल को नेल पे। सिरमा एते दाः उयुः ताना अउर आबुवा चास-बाड़ा के जीविका ओमोः ताना।\",\n        phonetic: \"Bahre gama rimil ko nel pe. Sirma ete dag uyug tana aur abuwa chas-bada ke jivika omog tana.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"रीमिल (Cloud)\", \"दाः (Water)\", \"सिरमा (Sky)\"]\n      },\n      ho: {\n        script: \"Warang Chiti / Devanagari\",\n        text: \"ᱵᱟᱦᱨᱮ ᱜᱟᱢᱟ ᱨᱤᱢᱤᱞ ᱠᱳ ᱱᱮᱞ ᱯᱮ। ᱥᱤᱨᱢᱟ ᱮᱛᱮ ᱫᱟᱜ ᱧᱩᱨᱩᱜ ᱛᱟᱱᱟ ᱟᱱᱫᱳ ᱟᱵᱩᱣᱟᱜ ᱪᱟᱥ ᱡᱤᱣᱤᱫ ᱛᱟᱱᱟ।\",\n        devanagariText: \"बाहरे गामा रीमिल को नेल पे। सिरमा एते दाग ञुरूग ताना आन्दो अबुवाग चास जीविद ताना।\",\n        phonetic: \"Bahre gama rimil ko nel pe. Sirma ete daag njurug tana aando abuwag chas jiwid tana.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"रीमिल (Cloud)\", \"दाग (Rain)\", \"चास (Crops)\"]\n      },\n      kurukh: {\n        script: \"Devanagari\",\n        text: \"बारी बाहरा पूस बादली एरके। बेड़ा ती छिपना अम्बु खतरी अरा नाम्है खेखल ता खेती के सींचे ननी।\",\n        phonetic: \"Baari baahra poos baadli erke. Beda tee chhipna ambu khatri ara namhai khekhal ta kheti ke sinche nani.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"अम्बु (Water)\", \"बादली (Cloud)\", \"खेती (Farming)\"]\n      },\n      kharia: {\n        script: \"Devanagari\",\n        text: \"बाहर बरखा कर बादल के देखा। अकास ले पानी गिरत हे अउर हामर खेत-बारी के सींचत हे।\",\n        phonetic: \"Bahar barkha kar badal ke dekha. Akaas le pani girat he aur hamar khet-bari ke sinchat he.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"बरखा (Rain)\", \"पानी (Water)\", \"खेत (Fields)\"]\n      },\n      bengali: {\n        script: \"Bengali\",\n        text: \"বাইরে বৃষ্টির মেঘের দিকে তাকাও। জলচক্র আকাশ থেকে বৃষ্টি এনে আমাদের ফসল ও গাছপালাকে পুষ্ট করে।\",\n        phonetic: \"Baire brishtir megher dike takao. Jolchokro aakash theke brishti ene amader fosol o gachpalake pushto kore.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"মেঘ (Cloud)\", \"বৃষ্টি (Rain)\", \"ফসল (Crop)\"]\n      },\n      odia: {\n        script: \"Odia\",\n        text: \"ବାହାରେ ବର୍ଷା ମେଘକୁ ଦେଖ। ଜଳଚକ୍ର ଆକାଶରୁ ବର୍ଷା ଆଣି ଆମ ଫସଲ ଏବଂ ଗଛଗୁଡ଼ିକୁ ପୁଷ୍ଟ କରେ।\",\n        phonetic: \"Bahare barsha meghaku dekha. Jalachakra aakasharu barsha aani aama fasala ebam gachhagudiku pushta kare.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"ମେଘ (Cloud)\", \"ବର୍ଷା (Rain)\", \"ଫସଲ (Crop)\"]\n      },\n      tamil: {\n        script: \"Tamil\",\n        text: \"வெளியே மழை மேகங்களைப் பாருங்கள். நீர் சுழற்சி வானத்திலிருந்து மழையைக் கொண்டுவந்து பயிர்களை வளர்க்கிறது.\",\n        phonetic: \"Veliye mazhai maegangalai paarungal. Neer suzharchi vaanathilirundhu mazhaiyaik konduvandhu payirgalai valarkkiradhu.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"மேகம் (Cloud)\", \"மழை (Rain)\", \"பயிர் (Crops)\"]\n      },\n      telugu: {\n        script: \"Telugu\",\n        text: \"బయట వర్షపు మేఘాలను చూడండి. నీటి చక్రం ఆకాశం నుండి వర్షాన్ని తెచ్చి మన పంటలను పోషిస్తుంది.\",\n        phonetic: \"Bayata varshapu meghalanu chudandi. Neeti chakram aakasham nundi varshanni tecchi mana pantalanu poshinstundi.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"మేఘాలు (Clouds)\", \"వర్షం (Rain)\", \"పంటలు (Crops)\"]\n      },\n      hindi: {\n        script: \"Devanagari\",\n        text: \"बाहर बारिश के बादलों को देखो। वर्षा का जल चक्र आसमान से पानी लाकर हमारी फसलों और पेड़ों को सींचता है।\",\n        phonetic: \"Bahar barish ke baadalon ko dekho. Varsha ka jal chakra aasman se pani lakar hamari phaslon aur pedon ko seenchta hai.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"बादल (Cloud)\", \"वर्षा (Rain)\", \"फसल (Crop)\"]\n      },\n      english: {\n        script: \"Latin\",\n        text: \"Look outside at the rain clouds. The water cycle brings rain from the sky to nourish our crops and trees.\",\n        phonetic: \"Look outside at the rain clouds. The water cycle brings rain from the sky to nourish our crops and trees.\",\n        vocabulary: [\"Clouds\", \"Rain\", \"Water cycle\", \"Crops\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n];\n'@ | Out-File -FilePath \"translations.js\" -Append -Encoding utf8","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\bhashasetu-ai","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":3000,"toolAction":"Append Presets 3, 4, 5 to translations.js","toolSummary":"Append Presets 3, 4, 5"}}]}
