{"step_index":57,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T17:57:05Z","thinking":"Planning to construct the `index.html` file, ensuring all requested elements for the hero section are included. This involves incorporating the project name, alternative name suggestions presented as pills, the tagline, a concise pitch, and an animated language marquee. It's crucial to confirm all specified features are implemented correctly.\n\n\nAnalyzing the structure for a clear, concise presentation of the problem, solution, and live demo. Focusing on visually representing key statistics and the \"before\" narrative to establish context. Then, creating an interactive demo with language selection and online/offline functionality to showcase the solution's core features.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"@'\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>BhashaSetu AI | AI-Powered Vernacular Pedagogy & Real-Time Translation Tool</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"AI-Powered Vernacular Pedagogy and Real-Time Translation Tool for Mother Tongue-Based Primary Education. Built for Smart India Hackathon 2024 - Government of Jharkhand.\">\n  \n  <!-- Google Fonts: Inter and Noto Sans for all Indic Scripts (Devanagari, Bengali, Tamil, Telugu, Odia, Ol Chiki) -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Noto+Sans+Bengali:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+Devanagari:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+Odia:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+Ol+Chiki:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+Tamil:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+Telugu:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  \n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"tribal-pattern-bg\">\n\n  <!-- =========================================================================\n       Navigation Header\n       ========================================================================= -->\n  <header class=\"navbar tribal-border-top\">\n    <div class=\"container nav-inner\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"brand-logo\">\n        <div class=\"brand-symbol\">\n          <span>भ</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"brand-text\">\n          <div class=\"brand-name\">\n            BhashaSetu <span class=\"ai-badge\">AI</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"brand-sub\">Govt. of Jharkhand • SIH 2024</div>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n\n      <nav class=\"nav-links\">\n        <a href=\"#problem\" data-i18n=\"nav_problem\">Problem</a>\n        <a href=\"#solution\" data-i18n=\"nav_solution\">Solution</a>\n        <a href=\"#demo\" data-i18n=\"nav_demo\">Live Demo</a>\n        <a href=\"#how\" data-i18n=\"nav_how\">How It Works</a>\n        <a href=\"#tech\" data-i18n=\"nav_tech\">Tech Stack</a>\n        <a href=\"#impact\" data-i18n=\"nav_impact\">Impact</a>\n        <a href=\"#video\" data-i18n=\"nav_video\">Pitch Video</a>\n        <a href=\"#team\" data-i18n=\"nav_team\">Team</a>\n      </nav>\n\n      <div class=\"nav-actions\">\n        <button id=\"langToggleBtn\" class=\"lang-toggle-btn\" title=\"Switch Language between English and Hindi\">\n          🌐 <span>हिन्दी</span>\n        </button>\n        <a href=\"#demo\" class=\"btn-primary\" data-i18n=\"nav_cta\">Launch Prototype</a>\n        <button id=\"mobileMenuBtn\" class=\"mobile-menu-btn\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\">☰</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Mobile Navigation Drawer -->\n  <div id=\"mobileNavDrawer\" class=\"mobile-nav-drawer\">\n    <ul class=\"mobile-nav-list\">\n      <li><a href=\"#problem\" data-i18n=\"nav_problem\">Problem</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#solution\" data-i18n=\"nav_solution\">Solution</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#demo\" data-i18n=\"nav_demo\">Live Demo</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#how\" data-i18n=\"nav_how\">How It Works</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#tech\" data-i18n=\"nav_tech\">Tech Stack</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#impact\" data-i18n=\"nav_impact\">Impact</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#video\" data-i18n=\"nav_video\">Pitch Video</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#team\" data-i18n=\"nav_team\">Team</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- =========================================================================\n       Hero Section\n       ========================================================================= -->\n  <section class=\"hero-section\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"hero-govt-badge\">\n        <div class=\"govt-emblem\">JH</div>\n        <span class=\"govt-text\" data-i18n=\"hero_badge\">Government of Jharkhand • SIH 2024 Problem Statement #1628</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hero-grid\">\n        <div class=\"hero-content\">\n          <h1>\n            <span class=\"highlight\" data-i18n=\"hero_title\">BhashaSetu AI</span>\n            <span style=\"display:block; font-size: 0.58em; color: var(--primary-navy);\" data-i18n=\"hero_title_hi\">भाषासेतु AI</span>\n          </h1>\n\n          <div class=\"hero-tagline\" data-i18n=\"hero_tagline\">\n            \"Every Child Learns Best in Their Mother Tongue\"\n          </div>\n\n          <p class=\"hero-desc\" data-i18n=\"hero_desc\">\n            Bridging the tribal-vernacular learning divide in 35,000+ rural Jharkhand primary schools with offline-capable Edge AI. Real-time classroom speech translation from Hindi/English into Santhali, Mundari, Ho, Kurukh, Kharia, and beyond.\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"hero-alt-names\">\n            <span class=\"alt-label\" data-i18n=\"hero_alt_names_label\">Alternative Linguistic Names:</span>\n            <span class=\"name-pill active\">BhashaSetu AI (भाषासेतु)</span>\n            <span class=\"name-pill\">VaniVahini (वाणीवाहिनी)</span>\n            <span class=\"name-pill\">AksharSetu (अक्षरसेतु)</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hero-cta-group\">\n            <a href=\"#demo\" class=\"btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 14px 28px; font-size: 1.05rem;\" data-i18n=\"hero_btn_demo\">⚡ Try Live Prototype</a>\n            <a href=\"#video\" class=\"btn-secondary\" style=\"padding: 14px 24px; font-size: 1.05rem;\" data-i18n=\"hero_btn_video\">▶ Watch Pitch Video</a>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"hero-stats-row\">\n            <div class=\"hero-stat-item\">\n              <span class=\"stat-val\" data-i18n=\"hero_stat_1_val\">40%+</span>\n              <span class=\"stat-lbl\" data-i18n=\"hero_stat_1_lbl\">Tribal Children in Rural Jharkhand</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hero-stat-item\">\n              <span class=\"stat-val\" data-i18n=\"hero_stat_2_val\">100%</span>\n              <span class=\"stat-lbl\" data-i18n=\"hero_stat_2_lbl\">Offline On-Device Capable</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hero-stat-item\">\n              <span class=\"stat-val\" data-i18n=\"hero_stat_3_val\">8+</span>\n              <span class=\"stat-lbl\" data-i18n=\"hero_stat_3_lbl\">Indigenous Languages Supported</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Hero Right Visual Card -->\n        <div class=\"hero-visual-card\">\n          <div class=\"classroom-sim-header\">\n            <div class=\"sim-tag\">\n              <div class=\"pulse-dot\"></div>\n              <span>Live Classroom Bridge Simulation</span>\n            </div>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted);\">Grade 1 • Chaibasa Block</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"teacher-bubble\">\n            <div class=\"bubble-sender\">👨‍🏫 Non-Tribal Teacher (Speaks Hindi)</div>\n        