rquee-lang\">Santhali / ᱚᱞ ᱪᱤᱠᱤ</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">ᱡᱚᱛᱚ ᱜᱤᱫᱽᱨᱟᱹ ᱟᱯᱱᱟᱨ ᱟᱭᱳ ᱟᱲᱟᱝ ᱛᱮ ᱯᱟᱲᱦᱟᱣᱜ-ᱟ</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Mundari</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">सोबेन गड़ाको अपना एंगा जगर ते सेचेद ओमोःआ</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Ho / ᱣᱟᱨᱟᱝ ᱪᱤᱛᱤ</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">ᱥᱳᱵᱮᱱ ᱜᱤᱫᱤᱨᱠᱳ ᱟᱯᱱᱟ ᱮᱝᱜᱟ ᱡᱟᱜᱟᱨ ᱛᱮ ᱥᱮᱪᱮᱫ ᱱᱟᱢᱮᱭᱟ</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Kurukh / कुड़ुख़</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">हुर्मी कुक्कुरु तंगहै एंगो कत्था ती बेस से पड़हओर</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">✦</span></div>\n      <div class=\"marquee-item\"><span class=\"marquee-lang\">Bengali</span><span class=\"marquee-phrase\">প্রত্যেক শিশু তার মাতৃভাষায় সবচেয়ে ভালো শেখে</span><span class=\"marquee-sep\">�